    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-111270",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-15T21:43:17.665Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-21T01:33:42.918Z",
      "description": "libmodplug through 0.8.9.1 contains a heap-based out-of-bounds write in CSoundFile::ReadDSM() in src/load_dsm.cpp because nPat is never checked against MAX_PATTERNS. Attackers can supply a crafted DSM file with over 240 PATT chunks or a wrapping patt_len value to corrupt heap memory and crash the consuming process.",
      "severity": 6.1,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Konstanty Bialkowski libmodplug\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/libmodplug-dsm-pattern-oob-write",
          "type": "reference"
        },
